\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.\cf0  The Lord's Wisdom call
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Herald on Highways
\par Calling to the children
\par All come to me!
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  2.   The fear of the Lord
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 That is Wisdom.
\par Knowledge and discernments
\par That follows it.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  3. My son, heed your father
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 In all his rulings
\par Your mother's directions,
\par Keep in your heart.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  4. It is your glory,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 And your turban too
\par It is your adornment,
\par That befits you.
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0 
\par \pard\fi-225\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  5.  If evil doers
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0 Deceive, divert you;
\par Seeking your destruction,
\par Stay away from them.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  6.  Never walk with them,
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0 Their paths lead to death.
\par When'ver they beckon you,
\par Run fast from them.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 7\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  7. Perfect fear of the Lord,
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0 Begins all wisdom,
\par Respectfulness and love,
\par \pard     That follows it.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

